>  25:      for (c in 1:C){
>  26:        eb0[c] <- z * b0[c];
>                                ^
>  27:      }

(2)
> No matches for:
>
>   vector[] ~ normal(int, int)
>
> ERROR at line 38
>
>  36:      }
>  37:      sigma ~ cauchy(0, 2);
>  38:      b0 ~ normal(0, 10);
                             ^
            For this one though, it seems to make sense to put 'b0[c] ~ ' in the same loop as 'a0[c] ~ '.
(3)
> ERROR at line 41
>
>  39:      theta[1] <- 0;
>  40:      for (i in 1:N) {
>  41:        theta[2:C+1] <- a0[1:C, id[i]] + x[i] * b;
>                    ^
