From: ua5e83218c834e013 at groups.google.com (Michael Betancourt)
Date: Tue, 05 Apr 2016 13:47:21 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-users] Initial Value Rejection with CVODE
Message-ID: <3Qdxnizb-B4.8pAamlbbAAAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <3Qdxnizb-B4.tGXOwcWpAAAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <3Qdxnizb-B4.tGXOwcWpAAAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
