From u1fe638ac9008754d at groups.google.com  Tue Apr 19 21:12:46 2016
From: u1fe638ac9008754d at groups.google.com (Ben Lambert)
Date: Tue, 19 Apr 2016 21:12:46 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-users] Quantifying the predictive capability of two models in a way consistent with ELPD
Message-ID: <_nQjOy5Sb0E.LlJk8MQ_BQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <_nQjOy5Sb0E.r7UveEwvBQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <_nQjOy5Sb0E.r7UveEwvBQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
