Subject: Speeding up Dynamic Regression Model with many time-periods and big sample size
Message-ID: <vH0RiyBuh1Q.vaWQZOYLBwAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/vH0RiyBuh1Q/m/vaWQZOYLBwAJ>
