From u8aa9b8cc06fdc99c at groups.google.com  Mon Apr 25 20:33:52 2016
From: u8aa9b8cc06fdc99c at groups.google.com (Bob Carpenter)
Date: Mon, 25 Apr 2016 20:33:52 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-users] Re: Speeding up Dynamic Regression Model with many time-periods and big sample size
Message-ID: <vH0RiyBuh1Q.fDWy-yAVBwAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <vH0RiyBuh1Q.vaWQZOYLBwAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
